1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 19=

4
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:03,820
(Wenhua Hall)

5
00:01:15,790 --> 00:01:16,350
It's done?

6
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:17,480
Your Highness.

7
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:20,070
The assassination failed.

8
00:01:20,430 --> 00:01:21,710
Zhao Boqing took refuge
in the government office.

9
00:01:21,820 --> 00:01:23,400
Our men couldn't get close to him.

10
00:01:23,610 --> 00:01:25,170
We managed to have
the displaced people surround the place,

11
00:01:25,170 --> 00:01:26,900
but he had grain
brought in from elsewhere in advance,

12
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:28,530
and the Imperial Guards quickly
brought the unrest under control.

13
00:01:28,870 --> 00:01:29,920
Once the situation had settled,

14
00:01:30,230 --> 00:01:31,870
our men had no choice but to withdraw.

15
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:34,950
There's one more thing.

16
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,430
He Xiaoyuan was there today too.

17
00:01:37,510 --> 00:01:38,510
She

18
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,230
took a fatal blow meant for Zhao Boqing.

19
00:01:42,430 --> 00:01:43,870
She took the blow for him?

20
00:01:44,790 --> 00:01:46,400
Why are you
telling His Highness this now?

21
00:01:46,430 --> 00:01:47,560
What's wrong with that?

22
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:49,840
His Highness is being
made a complete fool of!

23
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:52,560
Shen Zhuguang.

24
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,640
Prepare the carriage.

25
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,310
How is she?

26
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:10,080
The weapon that wounded this young lady

27
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,030
was coated with poison.

28
00:02:11,190 --> 00:02:12,310
The poison is spreading rapidly.

29
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:13,080
I'm afraid

30
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,080
she won't last until an Imperial Physician
arrives from the palace.

31
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,800
Is there really no way to save her?

32
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,520
The weather
is still cold at this time of year.

33
00:02:18,710 --> 00:02:19,800
Perhaps we could

34
00:02:19,870 --> 00:02:21,000
immerse her in ice water

35
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,430
to slow the spread of the poison.

36
00:02:22,630 --> 00:02:23,310
But

37
00:02:23,310 --> 00:02:25,310
this young lady
is barely clinging to life.

38
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,120
I'm afraid she may freeze
to death in the ice water

39
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,000
before the poison can even take effect.

40
00:02:29,150 --> 00:02:29,960
Break the ice.

41
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,150
Prepare a tub.

42
00:02:31,470 --> 00:02:32,280
Yes.

43
00:02:44,150 --> 00:02:44,960
Zhao Boqing.

44
00:02:45,710 --> 00:02:46,520
Tell me.

45
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,280
Am I

46
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:49,750
going to die?

47
00:02:50,630 --> 00:02:51,530
What nonsense are you talking about?

48
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,030
Don't say that.

49
00:02:53,910 --> 00:02:55,150
In the last lifetime,

50
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:58,430
you taught me to play
the zither at Qingyan Palace.

51
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,520
I couldn't learn,

52
00:03:00,910 --> 00:03:01,710
so

53
00:03:02,310 --> 00:03:04,240
you sat outside my courtyard

54
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:06,560
playing the zither
for most of the night.

55
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,280
You even complained
that I was too clumsy

56
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,310
to learn how to dance.

57
00:03:11,190 --> 00:03:12,360
So you had me

58
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,400
stand on your feet

59
00:03:14,630 --> 00:03:16,680
and taught me every step yourself.

60
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,630
At Ruanhong Pavilion,

61
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,360
I got upset

62
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,400
and said I couldn't beat you,

63
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,470
so I wanted to start another lifetime.

64
00:03:25,190 --> 00:03:28,150
You held me
as we fell into the flowering tree.

65
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:31,360
Petals filled the air.

66
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,870
It was so beautiful.

67
00:03:34,870 --> 00:03:36,080
You told me

68
00:03:36,750 --> 00:03:38,680
only by becoming stronger

69
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,540
would I have a chance

70
00:03:41,410 --> 00:03:43,220
to protect my own family.

71
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:46,310
Under the fireworks on the night
of the Lantern Festival,

72
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,960
I was afraid
the fireworks would frighten you,

73
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:52,400
so I covered your ears.

74
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,080
Your ears

75
00:03:55,150 --> 00:03:55,960
were

76
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:58,120
so warm then.

77
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,000
He Xiaoyuan.

78
00:04:00,310 --> 00:04:00,960
He Xiaoyuan.

79
00:04:01,190 --> 00:04:01,840
Don't fall asleep.

80
00:04:02,590 --> 00:04:03,360
I'm right here.

81
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,870
I'm listening.

82
00:04:05,310 --> 00:04:07,360
You promised me

83
00:04:07,910 --> 00:04:10,030
that once everything was over,

84
00:04:11,870 --> 00:04:12,840
you would...

85
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,310
You would watch the stars with me.

86
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,510
How I wish

87
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:20,870
that person

88
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:22,800
were you.

89
00:04:25,190 --> 00:04:26,800
But I know

90
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:28,750
you're not him.

91
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,750
You're not

92
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,420
the Zhao Boqing

93
00:04:34,900 --> 00:04:36,680
who stayed with me

94
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,830
through all thirty-four lifetimes.

95
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,950
My only regret is

96
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:46,830
that I can't...

97
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:47,680
Can't

98
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:52,040
meet you again.

99
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,360
He Xiaoyuan.

100
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,840
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

101
00:04:57,480 --> 00:05:00,480
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

102
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,510
He Xiaoyuan!

103
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:04,920
He Xiaoyuan!

104
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:08,080
♪My heart has long known♪

105
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:10,520
♪We made a promise long ago♪

106
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:12,440
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

107
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,360
Why?

108
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,870
Why did you suffer such a serious injury

109
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,830
because of me in the last lifetime?

110
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:21,750
He Xiaoyuan.

111
00:05:22,750 --> 00:05:23,560
He Xiaoyuan.

112
00:05:25,190 --> 00:05:26,310
As long as you survive,

113
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:27,800
I promise you

114
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:30,000
we'll find those lost memories together.

115
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,270
You're awake.

116
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:54,480
Let me see.

117
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,870
I heard what you promised me.

118
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,160
You believe

119
00:06:06,390 --> 00:06:07,830
what I told you

120
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:10,680
about our past together,

121
00:06:12,510 --> 00:06:13,190
don't you?

122
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:14,870
Zhao Boqing.

123
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:34,270
You once said

124
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:38,390
what hurt the most

125
00:06:39,750 --> 00:06:41,680
was when I didn't believe you.

126
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,040
In this lifetime,

127
00:06:45,390 --> 00:06:46,190
I feel the same.

128
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:09,510
Move!

129
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,070
Let me out!

130
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:12,590
Out of the way!

131
00:07:12,950 --> 00:07:13,600
Let go of me!

132
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:15,240
Move!

133
00:07:15,390 --> 00:07:15,830
Don't move!

134
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,310
- Stay still!
- Come here!

135
00:07:32,690 --> 00:07:33,430
What's going on?

136
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,920
It's all right.

137
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,430
Don't be afraid.

138
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:40,480
I'm here.

139
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:42,310
Those who hurt you

140
00:07:42,630 --> 00:07:43,750
will pay for it.

141
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,070
They gathered to cause unrest

142
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:56,160
and attacked a prince
and the Crown Princess.

143
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:57,430
That amounts to treason.

144
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,000
Execute them.

145
00:07:59,040 --> 00:07:59,870
Stop!

146
00:08:04,510 --> 00:08:05,430
Your Highness.

147
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:08,240
They're displaced people who rioted
out of desperation from hunger.

148
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,630
Their crimes don't warrant death.

149
00:08:10,830 --> 00:08:11,630
And what about you?

150
00:08:12,830 --> 00:08:13,630
Xiaoyuan.

151
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,000
Why did you

152
00:08:15,190 --> 00:08:16,800
come to such a dangerous place
outside the city?

153
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,270
I...

154
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,480
Do it.

155
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,070
No!

156
00:08:28,460 --> 00:08:29,100
Please spare me!

157
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,270
What?

158
00:08:37,510 --> 00:08:38,550
Scared now?

159
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,320
Don't be afraid, Xiaoyuan.

160
00:08:40,630 --> 00:08:41,630
I told you,

161
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:43,750
anyone who hurts you

162
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,840
will pay the price.

163
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,270
You said in the carriage last time

164
00:08:51,870 --> 00:08:53,270
that you needed time to think.

165
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,000
Now,

166
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,200
have you made up your mind?

167
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,670
(He's warning me.)

168
00:08:58,150 --> 00:08:59,510
(If Zhao Boqing
dares make a move on me,)

169
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,720
(he'll meet the same fate.)

170
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,720
(In this lifetime, Zhao Junyao)

171
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:03,510
(really has)

172
00:09:04,390 --> 00:09:04,840
(changed.)

173
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:08,550
I...

174
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,440
I've made up my mind.

175
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:13,670
During this trip,

176
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,720
the Seventh Prince
hardly even looked at me.

177
00:09:16,390 --> 00:09:18,150
It was all just
wishful thinking on my part.

178
00:09:24,030 --> 00:09:24,870
I

179
00:09:25,910 --> 00:09:27,150
will return to the palace
with Your Highness

180
00:09:28,630 --> 00:09:29,840
to choose my wedding dress.

181
00:09:33,390 --> 00:09:33,960
Good.

182
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:46,240
Thank you
for protecting Xiaoyuan, Boqing.

183
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:48,480
She left the city
with the Princess for an outing,

184
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:49,750
got herself into danger,

185
00:09:50,860 --> 00:09:51,890
and was fortunate to have you there.

186
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,960
(I don't know
whether what He Xiaoyuan said)

187
00:10:00,150 --> 00:10:01,960
(or those visions were real,)

188
00:10:02,510 --> 00:10:03,910
(but at this moment,)

189
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,750
(I feel strangely unsettled.)

190
00:10:05,820 --> 00:10:08,180
(Qingyan Palace)

191
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:09,030
Your Highness.

192
00:10:09,630 --> 00:10:10,960
I had someone investigate the poison.

193
00:10:11,390 --> 00:10:12,630
It appears to have come
from beyond our borders,

194
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,320
while the fabric

195
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:15,790
appears to be made from imperial tribute.

196
00:10:16,030 --> 00:10:17,240
Both inside and outside the palace,

197
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,510
there are quite a few political figures

198
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:20,600
who could use such a thing

199
00:10:20,790 --> 00:10:22,240
without leaving any trace.

200
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:24,670
He Xiaoyuan said before

201
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,390
that I

202
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:28,480
have already lived
through thirty-four cycles.

203
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,840
In thirty-three of them, I succeeded
in driving the Crown Prince to his death.

204
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:31,840
But in this lifetime,

205
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,120
I've lost my memories,

206
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,720
while the Crown Prince still has his.

207
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:35,910
Your Highness,

208
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:38,320
you don't really believe

209
00:10:38,390 --> 00:10:39,440
all that nonsense she told you, do you?

210
00:10:39,510 --> 00:10:40,720
I didn't before,

211
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:42,440
not until she risked her life to save me,

212
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,510
knew of my grand plan,

213
00:10:45,030 --> 00:10:46,240
and predicted the future.

214
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,910
If what she said is true,

215
00:10:49,030 --> 00:10:50,080
then among those with the power

216
00:10:50,870 --> 00:10:52,320
to plan ahead

217
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,200
and who have repeatedly

218
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,550
tried to kill me,

219
00:10:57,550 --> 00:10:59,750
Zhao Junyao should be a suspect.

220
00:11:00,790 --> 00:11:02,550
He Xiaoyuan said her feelings are dead

221
00:11:04,270 --> 00:11:05,910
and she no longer loves Zhao Boqing.

222
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:09,390
But I don't believe her.

223
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,120
This

224
00:11:16,390 --> 00:11:17,910
is called Silken Bond.

225
00:11:18,630 --> 00:11:20,000
It's a love Gu.

226
00:11:20,910 --> 00:11:23,120
Once you and Zhao Boqing both take it,

227
00:11:24,270 --> 00:11:25,510
he will

228
00:11:26,630 --> 00:11:27,720
see you as the love of his life.

229
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:31,670
If he already has someone he loves,

230
00:11:32,030 --> 00:11:34,510
all his memories and feelings
for that person

231
00:11:34,870 --> 00:11:36,480
will be transferred to you.

232
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,440
At tomorrow's palace banquet,

233
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,200
I want you, in front of everyone,

234
00:11:43,390 --> 00:11:45,840
to make He Xiaoyuan
give up on him completely.

235
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,390
Yes.

236
00:12:02,580 --> 00:12:04,900
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

237
00:12:05,260 --> 00:12:06,940
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

238
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:10,580
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

239
00:12:11,100 --> 00:12:15,420
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

240
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:18,180
♪My heart has long known♪

241
00:12:18,620 --> 00:12:20,620
♪We made a promise long ago♪

242
00:12:20,940 --> 00:12:22,540
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

243
00:12:23,220 --> 00:12:26,540
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

244
00:12:26,860 --> 00:12:29,700
♪How much must I let go♪

245
00:12:30,020 --> 00:12:31,700
♪For one moment♪

246
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:34,700
♪To hold each other close♪

247
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:39,260
♪Would that be enough?♪
